gize Cuthbert, Galahad, Maguire and Merlin from midnight Thursday."},{"t":"2026-10-12 14:09","kind":"nws","text":"NWS: a hot and dry Santa Ana; large and fast-moving fires are a concern. Gusts 35 to 70 mph Friday morning."},{"t":"2026-10-13 12:00","kind":"nws","text":"Fire Weather Watch for Thursday morning through Friday evening, Santa Monica Mountains and Malibu Coast. Humidity 5 to 15%."},{"t":"2026-10-14 06:37","kind":"sce","rung":"fill","text":"SCE: Merlin could be shut off as soon as 10:30 AM. Serra and Tuna added. Six Malibu circuits."},{"t":"2026-10-14 09:58","kind":"sce","text":"Nearly 90,000 LA County customers face possible shutoffs."},{"t":"2026-10-14 17:00","kind":"nws","text":"Red Flag Warning for the Santa Monica Mountains, Thursday 6 AM through Saturday 8 PM. Heat advisory, up to 95\u00b0F."},{"t":"2026-10-15 06:00","kind":"nws","text":"Red Flag Warning takes effect."},{"t":"2026-10-15 07:00","kind":"sce","text":"City: SCE may shut off central Malibu circuits this morning; timing changes often."},{"t":"2026-10-15 15:04","kind":"sce","text":"95,284 LA County customers in PSPS scope."},{"t":"2026-10-15 16:00","kind":"sce","rung":"hold","text":"Power off in central and west Malibu (City reports it out by 5 PM; exact time unpublished)."},{"t":"2026-10-15 16:41","kind":"fire","text":"Bryson Fire starts near Encinal Canyon Rd by Camp Kilpatrick. Evacuation orders for Encinal Canyon and Mulholland."},{"t":"2026-10-15 23:00","kind":"fire","text":"Evacuation warnings for Malibu zones MAL-C113 and MAL-C114."},{"t":"2026-10-16 07:00","kind":"sce","text":"69,746 SCE customers de-energized: LA County 34,946, Ventura 34,800."},{"t":"2026-10-16 12:29","kind":"sce","text":"LA County out: 52,953. Ventura facing shutoff: 57,120. Malibu especially hard hit."},{"t":"2026-10-16 15:00","kind":"fire","text":"Bryson Fire 147 acres, 39% contained, 7,221 structures threatened, none destroyed."},{"t":"2026-10-17 20:00","kind":"nws","rung":"hand","text":"Red Flag Warning ends. 